@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001

### Registro de usuario
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "amirsarmiento0430@gmail.com",
  "password": "Test1234!",
  "fullName": "Usuario Prueba",
  "documentId": "1093000005",
  "dataConsent": true
}

###

### Verificar email (reemplaza userId y code con los valores reales)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/verify-email
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "58bf09c3-1386-4a89-a341-2a6d6aafd0cd",
  "code": "377561"
}

###

### Login
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "amirsarmiento0430@gmail.com",
  "password": "Test1234!"
}

###

@token = {{login.response.body.access_token}}


### Recuperar contraseña
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@gmail.com"
}

###

### Clave pública JWKS
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/jwks

###

### Verificar token (reemplaza con el token real del login)
