### ─── ORGANIZATIONS ─────────────────────────────────────────

### Crear organización
POST {{baseUrl}}/organizations
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Club Hapkido del Cóndor",
  "type": "CLUB",
  "email": "condor@hapkido.com",
  "phone": "3001234567",
  "city": "Cúcuta",
  "country": "Colombia"
}

###

### Listar organizaciones
GET {{baseUrl}}/organizations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### ─── PLANES DE SUSCRIPCIÓN ──────────────────────────────────

### Crear plan Academy
POST {{baseUrl}}/subscription-plans
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Plan Academy Básico",
  "description": "Acceso a DINAMYT Academy para clubes pequeños",
  "appsIncluded": ["academy"],
  "maxUsers": 30,
  "priceMonthly": 50000,
  "priceAnnual": 500000
}

###

### Crear plan Campeonatos
POST {{baseUrl}}/subscription-plans
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Plan Campeonatos",
  "description": "Acceso a DINAMYT Campeonatos",
  "appsIncluded": ["campeonatos"],
  "priceMonthly": 80000,
  "priceAnnual": 800000
}

###

### Crear plan completo
POST {{baseUrl}}/subscription-plans
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Plan Ecosistema Completo",
  "description": "Acceso a Academy y Campeonatos",
  "appsIncluded": ["academy", "campeonatos"],
  "maxUsers": 100,
  "priceMonthly": 120000,
  "priceAnnual": 1200000
}

###

### Listar planes (público, sin token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/subscription-plans

###

### ─── SUSCRIPCIONES ───────────────────────────────────────────

### Crear suscripción para la organización
### (reemplaza orgId y planId con los UUIDs reales)
POST {{baseUrl}}/subscriptions
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "orgId": "UUID-DE-LA-ORG",
  "planId": "UUID-DEL-PLAN",
  "startsAt": "2026-06-02T00:00:00.000Z",
  "endsAt": "2026-12-31T23:59:59.000Z",
  "totalAmount": 500000
}

###

### Registrar abono de pago
### (reemplaza UUID-SUSCRIPCION con el id real)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/subscriptions/UUID-SUSCRIPCION/payment
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "paidAmount": 250000,
  "notes": "Primer abono del semestre"
}

###

### ─── VERIFICAR SCOPES TRAS SUSCRIPCIÓN ──────────────────────

### Invitar usuario a la organización
POST {{baseUrl}}/organizations/UUID-DE-LA-ORG/invite
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "email": "amirsarmiento0430@gmail.com"
}

###

### Login de nuevo para ver scopes actualizados
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "amirsarmiento0430@gmail.com",
  "password": "Test1234!"
}